40:["$","p","p-30",{"children":["当一个 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"panic"}]," 发生并开始向上传播时，Go 运行时会检查每个 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"defer"}],"。如果 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"defer"}]," 中包含 ",["$","code","code-3",{"className":"$undefined","children":"recover"}]," 调用，并且它被执行，那么 ",["$","code","code-4",{"className":"$undefined","children":"recover"}]," 会捕获当前的 ",["$","code","code-5",{"className":"$undefined","children":"panic"}],"，并且防止它继续向上传播。如果 ",["$","code","code-6",{"className":"$undefined","children":"defer"}]," 中再次发生 ",["$","code","code-7",{"className":"$undefined","children":"panic"}],"，那么原来的 ",["$","code","code-8",{"className":"$undefined","children":"panic"}]," 就不会被 ",["$","code","code-9",{"className":"$undefined","children":"recover"}]," 捕获，因为 ",["$","code","code-10",{"className":"$undefined","children":"defer"}]," 函数已经退出了。在这种情况下，新的 ",["$","code","code-11",{"className":"$undefined","children":"panic"}]," 会导致程序崩溃，因为没有更多的 ",["$","code","code-12",{"className":"$undefined","children":"defer"}]," 函数去 ",["$","code","code-13",{"className":"$undefined","children":"recover"}]," 这个新的 ",["$","code","code-14",{"className":"$undefined","children":"panic"}],"。"]}]
